  ╔═ Add a stack folder ═════════════════════════════╗  
  ║ ⚠ Read the host key of the server of             ║  
  ║   ssh://git.example.test/ops/stacks.git?         ║  
  ║                                                  ║  
  ║ This asks the git server of the address, so the  ║  
  ║ request leaves the host. Nothing is stored. The  ║  
  ║ host key is shown afterwards to compare and      ║  
  ║ confirm.                                         ║  
  ║ $ sudo qhost repo probe --output json --         ║  
  ║   ssh://git.example.test/ops/stacks.git          ║  
  ║                                                  ║  
  ║ [ yes, with sudo ]  [ enter cancel ]             ║  
  ║ y yes, with sudo  n/esc/enter cancel             ║  
  ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════╝  
                                                        
                                                        
                                                        
                                                        
                                                        
                                                        
                                                        
                                                        
                                                        
                                                        
